  "content": "<p>如果您在尋找Forge版本，就在這裡！&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-teams\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-teams</a></p><p>在我們的文件網站上了解更多關於FTB Teams的資訊：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdocs-teams\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/docs-teams</a></p><p>適用於能利用團隊進度功能的模組（如FTB Chunks和FTB Quests）的函式庫。在任務中，它允許多人共同完成相同任務；在FTB Chunks中，它讓方塊之間可以進行團隊互動，無需另外將其加入白名單。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>若要建立團隊，請使用「/ftbteams create 名稱設定」。若要更改設定，請使用「/ftbteams settings &lt;key&gt; &lt;value&gt;」，按Tab鍵可切換設定項目。團隊資料儲存在world/data/ftbteams資料夾中。</p><h2>支援服務</h2><ul>\n<li>若為<strong>整合包</strong>問題，請前往：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>若為<strong>模組</strong>問題，請前往：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>只是有疑問嗎？歡迎加入我們的Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>隨時掌握最新動態</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
